<PageLayout title="The girl behind the diary" description="A little introduction, from one daydreamer to another." eyebrow="SAKURA MIYU · さくらみゆ"><article class="panel about-content prose"><img class="about-avatar" src="/images/avatar.webp" width="150" height="150" alt="Sakura Miyu’s pink-haired anime avatar with a black bow" /><h2>Hi, I'm Sakura Miyu 🌸</h2><p>This little corner of the internet is where I write about everyday life, anime, cosplay, gaming, creativity, and the stories that sometimes appear in my imagination.</p><p>I love anime, video games, cosplay, Japanese culture, Gothic Kawaii fashion, creative writing, and beautiful little moments. This is my little world between reality and dreams.</p><p>I love wondering how familiar stories might change if a character made a different choice. Sometimes those little ideas become full stories.</p><p>I'm also studying Computer Science at university. I like the way code and creativity can meet — one helps me understand how things work, and the other gives me a reason to make something of my own.</p><blockquote>Some days, this space is a diary.<br />Other days, it's a door to an imagined world.</blockquote><p>Here you'll find ribbons beside save points, soft little thoughts beside story ideas, and the occasional page about learning something new.</p><p>Welcome to my little world between reality and dreams. I hope you find something here that feels a little like home. ♡</p><hr /><section lang="uk"><h2>Привіт! Я Сакура Мію.</h2><p>Люблю аніме, відеоігри, косплей, японську культуру, Gothic Kawaii, творчість і маленькі красиві моменти. Це мій маленький світ між реальністю та мріями.</p><p>Я створила цей куточок, щоб ділитися тим, що люблю, зберігати думки й знаходити людей зі схожими інтересами. Рада, що ти завітала або завітав. ♡</p></section><hr /><section lang="ja"><h2>はじめまして！さくらみゆです。</h2><p>アニメ、ゲーム、コスプレ、日本の文化、ゴシックかわいいファッション、創作、そして日常の小さな幸せが大好きです。</p><p>ここは、現実と夢のあいだにある私の小さな世界です。ゆっくりしていってくださいね。♡</p></section></article></PageLayout>
